WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.730
﻿That's some precise firing.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.900
﻿As such, it's easy to predict.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.540
﻿It's not my style to fight so cautiously!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.980
﻿You're a very decisive pilot.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.080
﻿You're tough. However...

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:33.820
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.860
﻿Impressive, Reiji.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:43.000
﻿But your own strength ﻿didn't win the battle.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.330
﻿It was the performance of
﻿Sei's Gunpla! Don't forget it!

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.300
﻿I'd rather say
﻿your Gunpla is simply obsolete.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.470
﻿Huh?

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.340
﻿One more battle! Just one more!

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.240
﻿What?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.810
﻿This time, I'll fight using
﻿my old guerrilla tactics...

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.680
﻿You're home.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.620
﻿- Hey, Sei.
- ﻿Won't you join us?

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.020
﻿My Best Mecha Collection Gouf
﻿is pretty strong.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:11.960
﻿- Come with me for a sec.
- ﻿What's up?

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.260
﻿Just come.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.930
﻿What do you want?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.270
﻿Reiji, tell me clearly.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:21.870
﻿What?

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.940
﻿Who... Who the heck...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:30.980
﻿Who the heck are you?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.310
﻿In a totally different world
﻿from the one Sei Iori lives in...

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.980
﻿There was a beautiful and
﻿peaceful country called Arian.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:21.550
﻿And there lived a fine prince
﻿who was the heir to the throne.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.860
﻿Now this prince had
﻿a great deal of curiosity,

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:30.230
﻿and one day he found a secret treasure
﻿in the treasure room of the palace.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.100
﻿Suddenly, the treasure began to move,

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.730
﻿and the prince's body was
﻿surrounded by an intense light!

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:42.940
﻿Now the prince was able
﻿to go to your world.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.940
﻿He immediately decided
﻿to go and explore it.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:51.180
﻿Everything was new, and
﻿he had an exciting few days.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.480
﻿And then...

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.950
﻿The prince encountered Gunpla.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.860
﻿You see, that prince is me.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.960
﻿I don't have a fever.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.600
﻿I'm not sick either.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:12.840
﻿I see. So you're a prince
﻿from another world,

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.270
﻿and you just happened
﻿to come to Earth.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.540
﻿You finally get it.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:20.680
﻿I get that you're insane.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.880
﻿Are you messing with me?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.220
﻿You'd have to be crazy
﻿to believe such a silly story.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.950
﻿But it's true.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.420
You saw me glow and disappear, right?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:34.230
﻿The sunset must have dazzled me
﻿so it looked like you vanished.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.330
﻿Are you ever gonna believe me?

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:39.230
﻿Okay, then prove it to me.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.670
﻿Take me to this other world.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.730
﻿That I can't do.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.640
﻿Then show me something
﻿like psychic powers or magic.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.540
﻿You read too much manga.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.210
﻿Darn you!

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.810
﻿Is that all you wanted to ask?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.080
﻿I was watching the store,
﻿so I'm going back.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.280
﻿- We're not done talking.
- ﻿Anyway...

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.190
﻿Don't you have something else to do?

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:07.990
﻿I want you to perfect it
﻿before the championship.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:13.500
﻿I want to fight against
﻿your truly completed Gunpla.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.800
﻿Yeah, you're right.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.770
﻿I'm taking time off
﻿starting tomorrow.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:22.870
﻿Hey, wait!

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.940
﻿What the heck?

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.750
﻿So he's a prince from another world?

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:35.520
﻿﻿I knew Reiji was strange, but
it turns out he's REALLY strange.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.220
﻿Don't believe it so quickly, mom.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:43.230
﻿But why would he tell
﻿such an obvious lie?

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.630
﻿I'm sure he has his reasons.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.230
﻿Like what?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.600
﻿I don't know.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.900
﻿But whoever Reiji is,

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:55.610
﻿you want to play
﻿Gunpla Battle with him.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.840
﻿Right?

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:05.820
﻿True, he is the only guy who
﻿can ideally move my Gunpla.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.520
﻿It might sound selfish,

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:13.390
﻿but I need his strength to
﻿get through the championship.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.360
Reiji said he was
﻿taking off for a while.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.070
﻿I wonder when he’s coming back.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.300
﻿You're late.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.740
Sorry. I'm still not
used to this world.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.880
﻿This world?

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.980
﻿Anyway, are you sure
﻿it's going to work out this time?

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.180
﻿They're all lousy ones so far.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.450
﻿I know. Follow me.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.220
﻿It's been ten years since
﻿the Plavsky particle was invented.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.890
﻿And this is the seventh year of
﻿the Gunpla Battle championship.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:25.630
﻿The popularity of Gunpla
﻿has spread throughout Asia,

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.870
﻿and even North America and Europe.

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:33.600
﻿But there are people who have always
﻿loved Gundam and Gunpla,

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.770
﻿even before the Gunpla Battle boom.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:39.010
﻿They're like old soldiers
﻿who've been through many battles.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:42.210
﻿Such people gather after work,

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:45.950
﻿and free themselves by
﻿fighting night after night.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:49.050
﻿Here is their battlefield.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.570
﻿- What do you think?
- ﻿Nice.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.010
﻿They all look like fanatics.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.940
﻿- L-Lieutenant!
- ﻿Lieutenant Ral!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.720
﻿Sieg Zeon! Sieg Zeon!

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:22.390
﻿Sieg Zeon!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.320
﻿What are they doing?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:25.920
﻿They're greeting us.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.090
﻿Have you come to sortie?
﻿It's been ages, sir.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.830
﻿I'd be proud to play with you!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.670
﻿No, it's not I who'll fight today.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.300
﻿It's this boy.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.070
﻿He's still just a kid.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.340
﻿But he must be special
﻿to have been recommended by you.

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:47.640
﻿When did you start with Gunpla?
﻿How many have you built?

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.950
﻿I've never built one.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.850
﻿You've never built one before?

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:56.320
﻿If you're not gonna build one,
﻿go buy a doll to play with!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.290
﻿Now, now, people.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:02.790
﻿A warrior must show his strength
﻿not by words, but on the battlefield.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.230
﻿Lend this boy a hand.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.870
﻿If you say so, sir.

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:13.440
﻿Reiji, you can also rent Gunpla here.
﻿Choose one you like.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.140
﻿Rent me the weakest Gunpla of all.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.380
﻿Here is the machine you ordered.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.450
﻿What's this?

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:25.980
﻿An Earth Federation Forces
﻿combat pod called the Ball.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.090
﻿AKA the spherical coffin.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.260
﻿Good. Okay, let's do this.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.290
﻿Let's play Gunpla Battle for real!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.130
﻿Bring it on, kid.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.130
﻿I'll make you cry like a baby.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.170
﻿Battle ended.

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:48.470
﻿S-So strong...

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.910
﻿Is this kid from the Flanagan Institute?

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.240
﻿I knew you could do it, Reiji.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.510
﻿It's impressive that you beat
﻿experienced soldiers with a Ball.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.250
﻿- Mr. Ral.
- ﻿What?

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.450
﻿I now know two things.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:07.090
﻿First, having used that Gunpla,
﻿I see how great Sei's Gunpla really is.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:12.560
﻿And the other is, it won't even
﻿be a workout with these guys.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:15.870
﻿His...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:20.500
﻿Tatsuya Yuuki's Gunpla is
﻿way stronger than this.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:25.140
﻿I want more. Is there anyone
﻿stronger around here?

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.880
﻿Don't get carried away, kid.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.050
﻿Don't mess with grown-ups!

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.850
﻿Five against one? That's crazy.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.590
﻿They're still just small fry!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.100
﻿No! Stop the fight!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.810
﻿Are you kidding? Just for this?

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.910
﻿This is it!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.050
﻿What!?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:18.630
﻿With only two shots, he shot
﻿down five Gunpla in motion...

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.970
﻿That Gunpla is...

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.570
﻿Who are you?
﻿Don't barge into my battle!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.110
﻿Oops, you didn't need me?

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:33.280
﻿Fellini...

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:38.550
﻿You're Ricardo Fellini of Italy.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:45.020
﻿You're interesting.
﻿How about playing head-to-head?

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.560
﻿Sounds fun.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.830
﻿Dad! Dad!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.900
﻿Sei, I finally did it.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.810
﻿I finished my Gunpla
﻿for the championship.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.940
﻿Fly, Gundam!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.480
﻿What do you think?

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:11.750
﻿Cool!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.690
﻿Right? It sure is!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:16.650
Iori?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.290
﻿Hey, Iori.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.960
﻿Kousaka.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.030
﻿Sorry, I must've fallen asleep.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:30.870
﻿The teacher wants to
﻿close up this art room.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:32.170
﻿Okay.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.970
﻿That's Gunpla, right?

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:35.810
﻿Yeah.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:39.040
﻿The shape looks different
﻿from when I last saw it.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.480
﻿Yeah. I finally finished it.

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:48.720
﻿This Gunpla has everything
﻿that I could imagine.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.890
﻿It's the Build Strike Full Package.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.890
﻿It has a variable-output beam rifle,

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.230
﻿a multi-layered chobham shield,

00:12:56.590 --> 00:13:00.200
﻿and a backpack fighter that can
﻿transform and move independently.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:06.100
﻿And with the backpack, its power
﻿is increased by over 160%.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.640
﻿I don't understand,
﻿but it sure sounds strong.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.780
﻿It's not only strong, but quick!

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:15.350
﻿So souped-up that an ordinary fighter
﻿wouldn't be able to handle it.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:19.520
﻿But I built it because
﻿Reiji should be able to control it.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:23.490
﻿Is Reiji the guy who came
﻿to school the other day?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:27.690
﻿Yeah. I'll enter the Gunpla Battle
﻿Championship with him.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.960
﻿I've got to go.
﻿Sorry for talking so much.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.800
﻿Please don't tell the teacher
﻿I was building Gunpla here.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.440
﻿Yeah, I know.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.370
﻿Thanks.

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.210
﻿Come to think of it...

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:48.750
﻿When we talked for the first time,
﻿at the beginning of school...

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.720
﻿Excuse me.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.090
﻿Iori?

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:57.990
﻿Oh, Kousaka?

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:00.660
﻿Oh yeah, you joined the art club.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.960
﻿I have permission from the teacher.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.330
﻿I came to borrow a chisel.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:09.900
﻿What?

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:13.970
﻿The drawing is good,
﻿but the colors are really nice!

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.240
﻿Thanks.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.110
﻿Do you like art?

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.910
Why?﻿

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:26.280
The teacher praised
﻿your drawing during art class.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.750
﻿I'm only interested
﻿in drawing sketches.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:34.420
﻿I want to visualize
﻿the images in my head.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.160
﻿So I wanted to learn
﻿the basics of drawing.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.300
﻿What for?

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:41.630
﻿Gunpla.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.910
﻿The thing that Iori
﻿is giving his heart and soul to...

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.880
﻿That he loses sleep to create...

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.220
﻿It's Iori's artwork.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.660
﻿That’s Gunpla.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:14.760
﻿This is a good shield!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.910
﻿My Gyan is the best.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.140
﻿With this, I can fight
﻿for another ten years!

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:39.720
﻿That's a pretty good
﻿Gunner Zaku Warrior.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:42.560
﻿So I hate to damage it.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:57.410
﻿But it's not good enough
﻿to drive me into a rage.

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:02.650
﻿I'm left unsatisfied and frustrated.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:08.420
﻿Is it arrogant of me
﻿to wish for a true battle?

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.320
﻿Kousaka?

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.760
﻿President Yuuki.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:19.500
﻿I didn't know you were
﻿interested in Gunpla Battle.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.830
﻿No, it's not like that.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:25.440
﻿Then I guess you're here to cheer
﻿for your classmate Iori.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:31.040
﻿He should be up after this match.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:43.020
﻿Battle ended.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.990
﻿My best Gunpla...

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:53.660
﻿President, everyone here worked
﻿really hard to build those robots.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.200
﻿Why would they fight with them?

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.170
﻿It's all because they
﻿worked so hard on them.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.270
﻿Their own Gunpla is the strongest.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.180
﻿Even if it damages their machines,
﻿they want to prove it.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.750
﻿That's why.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.580
﻿To prove their strength?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.490
﻿Iori's here.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.660
﻿But I don't see his partner...

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.090
We now begin match seven
﻿of the first round

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.830
﻿of the regional qualifying tournament.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:29.800
﻿Is he going to fight by himself?

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:32.540
﻿But his control skills are...

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.970
﻿Iori.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:38.070
﻿I know, but...

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.910
﻿Reiji just wants revenge on Yuuki.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.250
﻿It's only me who wants
﻿to win the championship.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.620
﻿I blame myself for
﻿dragging you into all this.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.650
﻿I got my hopes up too much...

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.660
﻿Like they say in Gundam,
﻿that's just my ego.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:59.800
﻿I mean, he has no common sense.
﻿And he's so willful.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.430
﻿Like he comes from another world.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.400
<i>﻿Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.880
﻿But even so...

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:20.180
﻿We made a promise to fight together.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.890
﻿Why? Why, Reiji?

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.820
﻿You fool!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.060
﻿Who's a fool?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.200
﻿Sorry I'm late.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.470
﻿Reiji.

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.340
﻿What happened to you?

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.910
﻿I'm fine. Let's start.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:45.810
﻿Can you fight without practice?

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:47.710
﻿Trust me.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.350
﻿I'll do that.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:54.820
﻿Take the Gunpla I built,
﻿a machine made just for you.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.720
﻿The Build Strike Full Package!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.260
﻿It's so perfect.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.230
﻿It was supposed to be mine.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:08.830
﻿I'm impressed you completed it
﻿to that level, Sei.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.580
- Let's go, Reiji!
- ﻿Yeah!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.780
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.510
﻿- Build Strike Full Package!
﻿- Let's go!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:47.870
﻿This is an amazing Gunpla, Sei!

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:50.210
﻿It's you who's amazing.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:54.110
﻿The performance is way higher,
﻿but you control it like your own body.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.910
﻿How do you do it?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:01.520
﻿I can't believe you made me
﻿fight 200 battles with you.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:08.320
﻿Show them that your skills are
﻿equally matched with the Italian champ's!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:12.700
﻿Target acquired! Beam rifle!

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.500
﻿Go!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.810
﻿Where does that power come from!?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.580
﻿With only one shot...!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.010
﻿Wow.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:33.550
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.190
﻿That was easy, Sei!

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:37.950
﻿Huh?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.190
﻿We won round one.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:43.890
﻿With the Gunpla I built.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:47.400
﻿Why are you looking so weepy?

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:50.070
﻿We're gonna keep winning, right?

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:50.730
﻿Yeah.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:54.200
﻿Let's practice more
﻿for next week's round two!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.210
﻿Toughest training, right?

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:10.820
﻿Now I've seen it, Iori.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:14.390
﻿The true performance
﻿of your new model...

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.540
﻿So this is Gunpla.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:35.480
﻿Reiji the fighter,
﻿and Sei Iori the builder.

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:39.280
﻿I never expected to see boys like them
﻿at a regional qualifying tournament.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:43.250
﻿Now I'm really excited
﻿for the world tournament!

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:20.780
﻿Welcome.

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:26.020
﻿Is that you, Kousaka?

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:28.660
﻿Couldn't you tell?

00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:33.300
﻿I've never seen you in plain clothes.
﻿It's kind of a different look.

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:34.660
﻿Did you need something?

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:37.500
﻿My little brother
﻿wants to build a Gunpla.

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.370
﻿Do you have any for beginners?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:40.600
﻿Yeah.

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:45.310
﻿I recommend this one.

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:45.840
﻿Iori.

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:46.680
﻿Iori.

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:49.850
﻿Are there any for girls?

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:51.780
﻿Of course.

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:57.460
﻿How tough is that opponent?

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:00.360
﻿To be honest, she's a big headache.

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.560
Next episode, "Gunpla Idol Kirara".

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:05.000
You'll see a hell of a Gunpla Battle!
